# A list scrolled past its first page: a click selects exactly the row
# clicked, the first and the last row of the page included; the
# pages are told apart by their rows.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
C 0 38
C 7 38
K CTRL-S
K PGDN PGDN
S PAGE2
C 6 30
S TOP
C 10 30
S ROW10
C 21 30
S LASTROW
C 11 70
S ROW11
K ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
